  "label": "Cultural Concept of Dark Comedy",
  "description": "Dark comedy is a genre of humor that derives its effect from subjects that are morbid, tragic, or taboo. The meme uses this cultural concept to create a poignant and ironic effect by juxtaposing the innocence of childhood with the grim reality of parental absence. This type of humor is often considered insensitive or harmful because it trivializes serious issues.",
